# The 8th Wall runtime, staged into public/ from node_modules by
# `npm run xr8:sync`. Generated from package-lock.json like anything else under
# node_modules, and the licence only permits distributing it unmodified — so
# there is nothing to gain by committing a copy that can go stale.
public/external/
